-- Author: S.Robinson
-- Created: Wed 8 Oct
--
-- Last modified by:
-- Revision:
--
-- Description:
-- Look up table for objects and pml functions for a given support type
-- This table tells MdsReadPars what object types to use/load during
-- reading of dimensions file for each support type
--
-- For this release the 'Set Param Function' has not been utilised
-- as specific functions have been written for each support type
-- or common functions with TYPE checks have been used (written by Neale)
--
-- This file enables different support type objects to be used for different
-- support types. However, I have managed to use the MDSSHOE object for all shoes,
-- lugs and anchors. Any-way-up this facility is here if it is needed
-- in the future!!!
--

!!mdsparatab.delete()
handle ANY
endhandle

!!mdsparatab = ARRAY()

